      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1931329481043534287",
      "text": "[1:34PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate  \n\nThe route from Dopemu, beginning underneath the bridge and continuing through Cement, Mangoro, Ile Zik, Ajayi Farm, and National, all the way to Bolade, is experiencing good conditions. \nThe return journey from Bolade to Dopemu is also proceeding smoothly.\n\nOur personnel are strategically positioned at various choke points and are actively managing the flow of traffic effectively. There are currently no impediments reported in these areas. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
